CORESIDENT|lane=continuation-and-new-laws|text=Colour binding is inconsistent between Law 31 and Law 36. Law 31 binds colour to RADIUS (red r=1, green r=2, blue r=3). Law 36 binds colour to DIRECTION (red = − inward, green = 0 hold, blue = + outward) and makes radius a separate axis (inner r=1, medium r=2, outer r=3). The same three colours in the same order carry two different meanings across the two laws, and nothing in either text reconcile|tag=CANON|json=0
