CORESIDENT|lane=his-own-voice-1|text=WHO WINS, three answers under three accountings: "increasing the allocation toward the matching target law produced a monotonic reduction in held-out predictive BPC" [0176] (gradient improves), "pure remained the best payload model" [0181] (specialist wins payload), "After charging the full raw prior for one window, cold still had the lowest complete cost" [0176] (cold wins complete cost). Not a r|tag=CANON|json=0
