CORESIDENT|lane=his-own-voice-1|text=NAMING COLLISION HE FLAGS HIMSELF: "Two different things are currently called 'one-third'" [0173] — "They are both valid, but they should be named distinctly", "Otherwise a reviewer could reasonably think the same phrase refers to the same simplex coordinate."|tag=CANON|json=0
