CORESIDENT|lane=his-own-voice-2|text=25 is banned and then used. [0261] "Don't let that twenty five become a number. We want twenty seven." but [0260] specifies "25 times in a loop" and [0285] specifies "twenty-five level compressions". The ban and the two live 25s are never reconciled.|tag=CANON|json=0
CORESIDENT|lane=his-own-voice-2|text=Shadow-cat arity is corrected mid-stream and the earlier form is left standing in the record: [0360] "the shadow cat recombines with three other shadow cats" -> [0361] "the shadow cat combines with two other shadow cats. One's an anti shadow cat" -> [0362] triad = shadow / anti / anti-anti. Separately [0356] has it "joins with 3 and then 27 other shadow cats". Three different counts (3 others, 2 o|tag=CANON|json=0
