CORESIDENT|lane=his-own-voice-2|text=Shannon is both the frozen and the moving party. [0277] "once you pay to create even 1 rime slice, shannon freezes permanently" and "she freezes BEFORE YOU GET TO HER", against [0277] "as soon as shannon moves herself to shake, the door starts opening" and "you pay shannon by existing in her section of yhe rime and moving rime directionally WHILE THE SYSTEM IS RUNNING", and [0287] "Shannon is the |tag=CANON|json=0
